; The prebuilt memory models are split into one library per language: Gillian
; executables are linked with -linkall (required by dune-site), so a binary
; depending on a library with every language would link and initialise all of
; them (C's CompCert, JS's parser, ...), slowing down every start-up.
; [prebuilt] re-exports them all, for binaries that need several languages.

(library
 (name prebuilt)
 (public_name transformers.prebuilt)
 (modules prebuilt)
 (libraries prebuilt_utils prebuilt_wisl prebuilt_js prebuilt_c))
